                        <th style="padding:12px 16px; text-align:left; border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">What you'll usually pay</th>
                        <th style="padding:12px 16px; text-align:left; border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">How it might ship (USPS service)</th>
                    </tr>
